  "body": "Home\nAbout us\nIndustries\nManufacturing and industrial\nArchitecture and Buildings\nServices\nScanning\nScan to BIM\nAs-Built Drafting\n3D Modeling\nBuilding analysis\nBOMA As-Built Digital Plans\nMatterport 3D Virtual Tours\nDigital Twins\nBlog\nCase studies\nContact\nGet in touch\n(514) 606-9604\nEnglish\nen\nFrançais\nfr\nCAREERS\nWe aim to expand our team of key partners\nStart a new adventure,\nJOIN THE TEAM!\nEvery great project starts with great people. We’re always looking for motivated, driven people who want to grow with us. Think you’d be a great fit? We’d love to hear from you.\nP\nroject manager\nGuide projects from start to finish, make a tangible impact, and grow alongside a collaborative team.\nDIGITAL\nMARKETING INTERN\nGain hands-on experience, bring your ideas to life, and build lasting skills.\nRevit Technician - (point cloud / 3d scan)\nTurn fieldwork into meaningful insights, make a tangible impact, and grow your expertise.\nLooking for something different?\nSend us a spontaneous application!\nLet’s Connect\nContact us !\nLouis Dallaire\nldallaire@pointspace.ca\n(514) 606-9604\nContact Us\nFirst name\nLast name\nEmail\nMessage\nThank you for contacting us.\nWe will get back to you as soon as possible.\nOops, there was an error sending your message.\nPlease try again later.\nShare by:",
